  description: "Satyrs are medium-sized fae with humanoid torsos and bestial lower
    bodies, marked by a clear tail and a restless stance. They move fast, bounding
    with energetic, springy steps. They don\u2019t speak clearly in words; their
    sounds are animalistic - laughs, bleats, snorts, and wild whoops - like a party
    that turned feral."
